{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02JB:statement", "parent_tag": "02J7", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "The following types of schemes are universally catenary.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> Any scheme locally of finite type over a field.\n<STRUCT_0003> Any scheme locally of finite type over a Cohen-Macaulay scheme.\n<STRUCT_0004> Any scheme locally of finite type over <MATH_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0005> Any scheme locally of finite type over a <MATH_0002>-dimensional\nNoetherian domain.\n<STRUCT_0006> And so on.\n<STRUCT_0007>\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathbf{Z}$", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "MATH_0002": "$1$", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-ubiquity-uc}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:d0da57c29dca03abfc07e7e62119a9c3dab629c038cdc8c47dbaf413bc14acce", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:12d310ff26da360168e47b1359ee3e6cf3d11ce3dbc4d035c54a1cf201f5cf66", "source_math_hash": "sha256:63dda1e4a6df74e1616d92b5fc66a35c02ef1ec368cff4b7f9ca836d318e3bc0"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02JB:proof", "parent_tag": "02J7", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "All of these follow from the fact that a\nCohen-Macaulay ring is universally catenary, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nAlso, use the last assertion of\nLemma <REF_0002>.\nSome details omitted.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-CM-ring-catenary}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-universally-catenary-local}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:a0d33414538218f82301ca6ac36dd421774d2a0f22a9bdb249891489b34849a6", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e49e3ff1573e50455202dce792b6226b91a327f9e50b9f2567945ce69de6bc2f", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
